WEBVTT

00:02.600 --> 00:07.600
The will was sent back to the capital the Second Prince Sikong Xu successfully ascended the throne.

00:07.680 --> 00:12.640
And changed the era name to Daxing the following year posthumously titled the late Emperor Sikong Yao as Wen.

00:12.720 --> 00:15.240
Historically known as Emperor Xuanwen.

01:12.360 --> 01:16.760
Your Majesty has arrived the Emperor has come to our place Your Majesty.

01:19.920 --> 01:22.200
Long live Your Majesty.

01:22.920 --> 01:24.400
Fellow villagers, rise quickly.

01:26.760 --> 01:28.160
Thank you, Your Majesty.

01:28.360 --> 01:30.360
Thank you, Your Majesty.

01:31.360 --> 01:35.360
Xunyang why did you bring me here?

01:37.560 --> 01:43.480
Some time ago I passed through here and heard about their situation that's why I thought.

01:44.400 --> 01:46.400
Your Majesty should come and see.

01:50.360 --> 01:54.480
Is there not a single young person in this village?

01:57.360 --> 02:01.800
Men of military age have all gone to the border to guard the frontier for Your Majesty.

02:01.880 --> 02:06.280
Since Your Majesty ascended the throne you've fought so fiercely that enemies tremble at the news.

02:06.360 --> 02:09.080
We can finally stand tall.

02:09.960 --> 02:11.960
Is that so.

02:12.920 --> 02:18.000
When Your Majesty goes north again Emperor Xuanguangwu.

02:20.280 --> 02:25.520
My three sons all grew up hearing the late Emperor's stories to guard the nation's gates with Your Majesty.

02:25.600 --> 02:27.267
Brings honor to our ancestors.

02:28.360 --> 02:33.040
They all served in the same camp all entered the same camp.

02:34.240 --> 02:36.240
All made contributions to Great Xuan.

02:37.320 --> 02:41.160
Your Majesty my eldest son Dago was a vanguard for General Zhu.

02:41.240 --> 02:43.080
General Zhu personally buried him.

02:45.400 --> 02:49.720
My eldest and second sons both died in battle beyond the pass not a single coward.

02:51.640 --> 02:53.307
Fellow villagers, you've worked hard.

02:54.360 --> 02:57.480
You've worked hard.

03:02.120 --> 03:06.640
Xuan Kingdom's people love Your Majesty this is just an ordinary village.

03:07.160 --> 03:13.040
But precisely because it's nothing special I think one can see the whole from a part.

03:14.280 --> 03:16.280
See the whole from a part.

03:19.560 --> 03:21.227
Is every village like this?

03:23.400 --> 03:29.440
All filled with lonely elderly, disabled, women and children.

03:31.640 --> 03:37.280
According to state law, men receive land at twenty, farm for three years.

03:38.400 --> 03:39.800
Try to leave descendants.

03:41.400 --> 03:46.600
At twenty-three, they should enter the army and serve the state.

03:47.600 --> 03:51.760
Father once said he hoped I would become a hegemon.

03:52.920 --> 03:54.320
So I thought.

03:55.560 --> 03:59.520
I want to do better than elder brother to support the people.

04:00.320 --> 04:04.440
Lift up the backs of our Xuan people xunyang.

04:05.920 --> 04:11.480
What do you think of these years have I done right or wrong?

04:12.600 --> 04:18.600
Your Majesty has never failed the people or Father.

04:24.000 --> 04:28.707
In the past, elder brother repeatedly advised me I turned a deaf ear.

04:29.160 --> 04:34.973
Today Xunyang, you tricked me into coming here and I've awakened from a great dream.

04:37.760 --> 04:42.640
I should stop.

04:43.440 --> 04:45.400
Your Majesty.

